gartip.row.price = Price\tGrows with size
gartip.row.reach = Reach\tGrows with size
gartip.row.fire_rate = Fire rate\tSame in any building
gartip.row.ammo = Damage, ammo\tSame in any building
gartip.note = So a smaller building can be the better buy: the same firepower for less money, where it reaches far enough.
