zcost.note = Zones that touch or overlap count as one safe zone. Zones within {gap} m of each other share one land price. Past the land limit your zones turn red and the outbreak can't start. As you draw, your money shows the price.
placetip.click_title = CLICK MODE
placetip.click = A click places one garrison, mortar or Turret in the building you click, or upgrades the one unit you click. Dragging adds nothing.
placetip.paint_title = PAINT MODE
placetip.paint = A click fills every building inside the circle at the cursor, or upgrades every unit inside it. Hold and drag to keep painting.
