placetip.paint_note = Anything that can't take one is skipped. For the garrison, mortar, Turret and Upgrade Unit tools.
zonetip.title = NO CIVILIANS INSIDE
zonetip.effect = Nobody stands in this zone, so it shelters no one: it is not a safe zone, and a gun in it gets the limited ammo of a gun outside every zone.
zonetip.note = Draw a zone over ground where civilians stand, or join it to a zone that holds some, to make it a safe zone.
evactip.corridor = Click where the corridor starts and drag to where it ends. Calm civilians inside it walk along the streets to the arrow end, round the buildings in the way, at their running speed. Panicked civilians run down it too, unless it points back toward the zombies.
evactip.corridor_note = Civilians in a corridor follow it and ignore evac holds. An arrow end at a safe zone's gate leads them in through the gate. The mouse wheel sets its width while you drag.
evactip.hold = Click where the centre goes and drag out to the edge. Calm civilians near it, out to its faint outer ring, walk in and stay inside. A civilian that panics ignores it and can leave.
evactip.hold_note = Civilians inside an evac corridor follow the corridor instead.
