loadout.unit.garrison = Average machine gun unit located in buildings. Larger buildings provide more range for garrisons, but all garrisons start with the same fire rate and ammo, so smaller buildings are actually better under some circumstances. Click and drag to garrison every building you pass over.
loadout.unit.sniper = High damage and very far range with a limited sight radius. Taller buildings provide more range. Prioritizes mutated enemies first, then higher health ones.
loadout.unit.mortar = Low fire rate but deals AOE damage. Very efficient at eliminating tightly clumped enemies. Click and drag to place one on every building you pass over.
loadout.unit.turret = Extremely high fire rate. Placed in a building. It can't be resupplied with ammo, even inside a safe zone.
loadout.unit.mine = Small explosive. Click and drag to set multiple.
loadout.unit.c4 = Huge explosive. Must be detonated manually.
