loadout.unit.spike_strip = Paint it on the street with a wide brush. Zombies on it walk slowly. Hold Shift to erase.
loadout.unit.oil_slick = Paint it on the street with a wide brush. A blast or fire sets it alight, and the fire races across the whole slick. Hold Shift to erase.
loadout.unit.napalm_drum = Huge fire bomb. Must be detonated manually, and sets the ground on fire.
loadout.unit.howitzer = Huge range from a rooftop, but it can't hit anything close. Very slow fire.
loadout.unit.mlrs = Fires a ripple of 12 rockets across a pack, then reloads for a minute.
loadout.unit.railgun = Fires from ground level: one round flies along the street through every enemy in its path until it hits a building or leaves the map, then a long reload. Aims only where no building is in the way. Placed in a building. Like the Turret, it can't be resupplied with ammo, even inside a safe zone. Aimed like the sniper: it fires only inside a narrow cone the way it faces. A building it hits takes its damage too.
