editor.about.river = Click points along the river; it is drawn this wide.
editor.about.coast = Draw the shore with the land on your LEFT: the sea fills the right side, up to the roads. Easier: draw the sea with WATER.
editor.about.green = Click the corners of a park or a wood.
editor.about.nociv = Drag from the middle out. Keeps civilians out of an area (zombies can still come).
editor.about.stages = A map's levels are its stages, played in order: each stage's play area must contain the last one's. AUTO sizes the outbreak and the budget from the stage's land.
editor.about.image = Put a picture from your computer under the map to trace over: a street map, a satellite view, a sketch. Only you see it, here in the editor: it is never part of the map, the game or the Workshop.
